WEBVTT

l1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
I know that look, I know that sound

l2
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.000
There's probably a tennis ball around

l3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Don't you tell me that you left it in the car

l4
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
I have seen exactly where you are

l5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!

l6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!

l7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Throw it down the garden, throw it down the hall

l8
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.000
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!

l9
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Twenty-seven times and you're getting tired

l10
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.000
Twenty-seven times and I'm still wired

l11
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.500
You can put your coat on, you can turn out the light

l12
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:06.000
I will be here holding it all night

l13
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.500
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!

l14
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.000
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!

l15
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.500
Nothing in this world has ever mattered more at all

l16
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:26.000
Gimmie! Gimmie! Ball!
